            "category": null,
            "description": "Record a cross-AI review round of a phase's plans (GSD NN-REVIEWS.md): its reviewers, lanes, coverage and consensus, and one concern each; with a round named, more unchecked symbols and concerns of that round",
            "export": "cmd__record_review",
            "id": "record_review",
            "title": ""
          },
          {
